  "detail_text": "Special Notice Special Notice Page 1 of 3 Special Notice *= Required Field Special Notice Page 4 of 4 Special Notice Notice of Intent to Award a Sole Source Procurement The Department of Veterans Affairs, Veterans Health Administration, Network Contracting Office 17, intends to award a firm-fixed priced contract to Richard-Allan Scientific LLC.: Scope Lab Histology Equipment Service Maintenance Agreement for VA owned Histology Lab Equipment for the VA Texas Valley Coastal Bend (VCB) Health Care System, 2601 Veterans Drive, Harlingen, TX 78550. For the following equipment: Quantity Manufacture Product Serial # Location 1 Fisher Scientific Clearvue Glass Coverslipper CV74692404EP 3rd Floor Lab 1 Thermo Scientfic Embedding Unit Paraffin HS9517A2008T 3rd Floor Lab 1 Thermo Scientific Tissue Embedding Unit HS9515C2008 3rd floor Lab 1 Thermo Fisher Scientific Excelsior AS ET71132101EP 3rd floor Lab Location The preventive maintenance will be performed at the VCB Health Care Center at Harlingen (HCC), located at 2601 Veterans Drive, Harlingen, Texas 78550. Period of Performance The Contract period of performance: Base 06/01/2026 05/31/2027 Option 1 06/01/2027 05/31/2028 Option 2 06/01/2028 05/31/2029 Option 3 06/01/2029 05/31/2030 Option 4 12/01/2030 11/30/2031 See Statement of Work for complete details.",
